@startuml plant-watering

' id: moisture-sensor
' req: R1
component "MoistureSensor" as MoistureSensor

' id: watering-controller
' req: R1, R2
component "WateringController" as WateringController

' id: pump-driver
' req: R2
component "PumpDriver" as PumpDriver

' id: scheduler
' req: R3
component "Scheduler" as Scheduler

' id: moisture-reading
interface "MoistureReading" as MoistureReading

MoistureSensor --> MoistureReading : publishes
WateringController --> MoistureReading : reads
WateringController --> PumpDriver : commands
Scheduler --> WateringController : triggers

note right of WateringController
  Decides when to water from
  moisture level and schedule.
end note
@enduml
